{{Finnish index|ku}}

===Pronoun===
'''kumpikaan'''
# {{indefinite}} (''in question clauses'') [[either]].
#:*''[[tietää|Tietää]][[-kö|kö]] '''kumpikaan''' [[te#Finnish|teistä]], [[missä]] [[se#Finnish|se]] [[olla#Finnish|on]]?''
#:**''Does '''either''' of you know where it is?''
# {{indefinite}} (''[[:Category:Finnish negation verb forms|with a negation verb]]'') [[neither]], [[not]] ... [[either]].
#:*'''''Kumpikaan''' ([[he]]istä) [[ei]] [[sanoa|sanonut]] [[sana#Finnish|sanaa]][[-kaan|kaan]].''
#:**'''''Neither''' (of them) said a word.''
#:*''[[älä|Älä]] [[puhua|puhu]] [[tämä|tästä]] '''kummallekaan'''!''
#:**''Don't talk to '''either''' about this!''

